NAME
       lspci - list PCI devices

SYNOPSIS
       lspci [-v]

DESCRIPTION
       Lists every PCI device with its address, class, vendor and
       device id.

OPTIONS
       -v     also show the BARs, interrupt line and the MSI and MSI-X
              capabilities

EXAMPLES
       lspci -v

SEE ALSO
       lsusb(1), dmesg(1)
